sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Application
    participant ai4rag as ai4rag Library
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>HTTPS / TLS<br/>AWS Credentials
    participant OGX as OGX Inference Service<br/>HTTPS / TLS<br/>API Key Auth

    Note over User,OGX: Document Ingestion Phase

    User->>ai4rag: Configure S3 bucket & credentials<br/>(AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID, AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY)
    ai4rag->>S3: Connect via boto3<br/>HTTPS / AWS Access Key
    S3-->>ai4rag: Document files
    ai4rag->>ai4rag: Extract text (Docling)

    Note over User,OGX: Chunking Phase

    ai4rag->>ai4rag: Chunk text<br/>(Langchain or Docling strategy)

    Note over User,OGX: Embedding & Storage Phase

    ai4rag->>OGX: Generate embeddings<br/>POST /embeddings<br/>API Key Auth, HTTPS
    OGX-->>ai4rag: Embedding vectors
    ai4rag->>OGX: Store in vector store<br/>API Key Auth, HTTPS
    OGX-->>ai4rag: Storage confirmation

    Note over User,OGX: RAG Generation Phase

    ai4rag->>OGX: Retrieve relevant chunks<br/>Similarity search<br/>API Key Auth
    OGX-->>ai4rag: Retrieved context
    ai4rag->>OGX: Chat completion<br/>POST /chat/completions<br/>API Key Auth, HTTPS
    OGX-->>ai4rag: Generated response

    Note over User,OGX: Optimization Loop (repeated)

    loop Hyperparameter Search (GAM Bayesian / Random)
        ai4rag->>ai4rag: Adjust parameters<br/>(chunk size, overlap, retrieval depth)
        ai4rag->>OGX: Re-embed & re-generate<br/>API Key Auth
        OGX-->>ai4rag: Results
        ai4rag->>ai4rag: Evaluate quality<br/>(LLM-as-Judge / Unitxt)
    end

    Note over User,OGX: Output Phase

    ai4rag->>ai4rag: Generate optimized<br/>Jupyter notebook artifact
    ai4rag-->>User: Deployment-ready notebook<br/>with optimized RAG config
